      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1792013116275,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Setting\nStore: ABC for Data Layer\n    -  In Memory \n    -  MongoDB\nWorkingMemory: Context(Redis)\nUserMemory\n    - role\n    - preference\n    - query_count\n    - feedback_count\nDeptMemory: Dept's Knowledge (Skills/hooks/FAQ/Trends)\n    -  DataStore\nEPisodicMemory: Memory about episodic history\n    - upsert the conversation event to db\nMemoryContextBuilder\nOrganizationMemory\n    - version/ expire/ audit/ access\nAgents\n    - intent\n    - Retrival\n    - Answer\n    - verifier \n    - Feedback\n    - dept router\n    - query rewritter\nEngine\n    - loop engine\n        - observe + Reflect + Adapt (make corrections) + deploy \n    - hook engine\n    - rule engine \nSkill Executor \n \n\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 843,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Setting\nStore: ABC for Data Layer\n    -  In Memory \n    -  MongoDB\nWorkingMemory: Context(Redis)\nUserMemory\n    - role\n    - preference\n    - query_count\n    - feedback_count\nDeptMemory: Dept's Knowledge (Skills/hooks/FAQ/Trends)\n    -  DataStore\nEPisodicMemory: Memory about episodic history\n    - upsert the conversation event to db\nMemoryContextBuilder\nOrganizationMemory\n    - version/ expire/ audit/ access\nAgents\n    - intent\n    - Retrival\n    - Answer\n    - verifier \n    - Feedback\n    - dept router\n    - query rewritter\nEngine\n    - loop engine\n        - observe + Reflect + Adapt (make corrections) + deploy \n    - hook engine\n    - rule engine \nSkill Executor \n \n\n",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
