      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "intent_agent: understand intent\n1. retrieve the memory\n2. intent_agent.infer() -> Intent (type, depts, user_role... raw(original response)\n    - query\n    - user_id\n    - memory: from 1\n    use pi, if no instance use python \n3. add to work memory\n\n    ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
