      "updated": 1791837087905,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "dept.answer_many /integration/dept_agent_clinet.py\n    - asyncio fire answer_one for each depts (resolved depts)\n    - in case failed\n        - downgrade to python call \n            - retrieval\n            - rule\n            - answer agent \n            - enrich citation \n    - return response\n\n\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 293,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "dept.answer_many /integration/dept_agent_clinet.py\n    - asyncio fire answer_one for each depts (resolved depts)\n    - in case failed\n        - downgrade to python call \n            - retrieval\n            - rule\n            - answer agent \n            - enrich citation \n    - return response\n\n\n",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
