      "updated": 1791837087906,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "/retrieval \n1. bm25\n    search based on bm25\n2. vector\n3. reranker\n    - bge reranker\n    - crossEncoderReranker\n    - heuristicReranker: rank by overlap (q_token & c_tokens)\n4. hybrid\n    - combine vector + bm25\n    - use RFF \n        - 1 / (RFF(60) + Rank)\n        - vector rank + bm25 rank ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 318,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "/retrieval \n1. bm25\n    search based on bm25\n2. vector\n3. reranker\n    - bge reranker\n    - crossEncoderReranker\n    - heuristicReranker: rank by overlap (q_token & c_tokens)\n4. hybrid\n    - combine vector + bm25\n    - use RFF \n        - 1 / (RFF(60) + Rank)\n        - vector rank + bm25 rank ",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
